Package: tennisagegap
Title: Career Matches and Opponent Age Gaps from Tennis Abstract
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Lance (YiZhuo)", "Li", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "lanceli0802@gmail.com")
Description: Retrieves the career matches of a professional tennis player
    from Tennis Abstract (<https://www.tennisabstract.com>), cleans them into
    a data frame of player age, opponent age and match result, and draws a
    scatter plot in the style of the New York Times graphic of Serena
    Williams's matches by age.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.1.7)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
